  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine ground pistachios, yuzu juice, vegan Worcestershire sauce, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper. Mix well until a sticky dough forms.",
    "Gradually add ice-cold water to the dough, mixing until it comes together in a ball.",
    "Divide the dough into 4 equal portions and shape each into a ball.",
    "Flatten each ball into a patty shape, about 1 inch thick.",
    "Heat a non-stick skillet or grill over medium heat.",
    "Cook the patties for 3-4 minutes per side, or until they're golden brown and cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the brioche buns on the grill or in a toaster.",
    "Assemble the burgers by spreading vegan mayo on the bottom bun, followed by a cooked patty, lettuce, tomato, and top bun.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
